			"notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Thedustbustr/Carpet-Extra-Extras/compare/26.3-1.4.2...26.3-1.5.0\n\n- Added experimental `pistonPushDesyncFix` rule.\n- Added `tintedGlassHidesBeaconBeam` rule.\n- Improved the consistency of lazy chunk detection that is used by the `optimizedTNTInteraction` rule.\n- Fixed bug where the `shulkerBoxStackLimit` rules did not properly check the item similarity and stack size.\n- Fixed bug where commands would unload when using `/reload`.\n- Fixed bug where some data from rules would not be cleaned up on server close.\n- Fixed bug where a bad `/warp` command destination could cause a crash.\n- Fixed bug where the carpet bot count was not consistent between dimensions in sleep calculation.\n- Fixed bug where a player could rarely get stuck in the `/cam` command."
		},
